# m57_win: the second side is left without units when the first pass
# begins (unit_count is byte 2 of a unit's 1Ah-byte record; its units 4
# to 7 get 0 and are dropped at the first round's end), so that the
# battle ends at the first round's end without a fight or a cursor's
# step.  Not the game's own doing: a poke, for the window's comparison
# of a battle's end.  TARGET HEX a line, as the runner's -poke.
unit_count+68 00
unit_count+82 00
unit_count+9C 00
unit_count+B6 00
